※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4205 LANG_TYPE_OPERAND_NOT_INTEGER

※ Two truth values can be the same or different; neither comes before the
※ other.  Equality is defined on them and ordering is not.
let ready: bool = true
let seen: bool = false

@[startup]
fn main() → bool:
    ready < seen
